## Analytical Architecture & Implementation Plan

To build Mubashir Hussain's personal portfolio website as a fresher full-stack developer, we synthesize two powerful design directions:

1. **The Interactive Neon Tubes Background (`threejs-components`)**: Providing an immersive, responsive 3D cursor-interactive backdrop across the initial starting page/hero and seamlessly blending into the high-end dark editorial theme.
2. **The Dark Editorial Record-Label Aesthetic**: Inspired by high-end design principles—near-black ground (`#0A0C0E`), warm bone ink (`#EDE7DC`), amber (`#E8913C`) & teal (`#2E6B72`) accents, geometric typography (`Syne` + `Sora`), a portal hero section with scroll-driven split-type kinetic typography and expanding panels, and a throwable interactive card deck for projects.

### Core Sections Map (9 Total Sections + Custom Layout Rules)

1. **Profile Picture (DP) & Background Banner**: Text left, picture right (zig-zag 1). Includes banner image and glowing neon ring DP.
2. **Headline / Portal Hero**: Picture left, text right (zig-zag 2). Driven by scroll position with split-wordmark tracking/scaling, revealing a full-bleed portal image.
3. **About / Summary**: Text left, picture right (zig-zag 3). Highlighting full-stack background, academic journey, and passion for clean engineering.
4. **Experience**: Picture left, text right (zig-zag 4). Tailored for a fresher showcasing Apna College full-stack coursework, internships, and project milestones.
5. **Education**: Text left, picture right (zig-zag 5). FSc Pre-Engineering and BS Computer Science studies.
6. **Skills**: Picture left, text right (zig-zag 6). Animated skill chips and progress bars (HTML, CSS, JS, Node.js, Express, MongoDB, Mongoose, Bootstrap, Git/GitHub, C++).
7. **Licenses & Certifications**: Text left, picture right (zig-zag 7). Course completion certificates with direct verification links.
8. **Projects**: Picture left, text right (zig-zag 8). Interactive throwable deck or project cards with Live Demo and GitHub repository links.
9. **Languages & Interests**: Text left, picture right (zig-zag 9). Language fluency badges and music production/coding interests.

